    "long_instructions": "## Explore How Values Change\r\n\r\nRefer to your [Variables and Live Updates Activity Guide](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dFcNEz0oOWTFCtAt-6smlN1EQgRpzqLZ6ewgr_Q3XYQ/edit?usp=sharing) for each step’s instructions.\r\n\r\n**1. Change the starting value**\r\n\r\n**2. Change what the buttons do**\r\n\r\n**3. Try using text instead of a number**\r\n\r\n**4. Prevent a value from changing**\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n:::details [Not Sure Where to Start?]\r\nIf you’re not sure what something is in the code or how it works, take a picture of it and upload it to AI Tutor.\r\n:::\r\n ",
